    intro="Agile metrics and KPIs are the measures teams and leaders use to see whether Agile work is delivering value predictably, at good quality and at a sustainable pace. The best set is small and balanced: a few flow or delivery measures, one or two quality measures, an outcome measure and a team health check, reviewed as trends rather than targets. This guide explains each metric with formulas and worked examples, shows how to measure across several teams and a portfolio, and gives you a step-by-step way to choose your own.",
